    {
      "id": "F11",
      "claim": "The Go source changes since v0.0.1 are in go/internal/providers/chat_fields.go (GitHub Copilot counts response_format as sent unless its cached catalog row serves the model over Responses), go/internal/providers/extension_vertical.go (Edge TTS synthesis sends the companion daemon an OpenAI speech JSON body with input, speed and the catalog credential), go/internal/roster/store.go (the roster cache records its feed URL and a cache of another feed is set aside), go/internal/operations/secure_windows.go (Windows renames retry sharing violations for up to two seconds), their tests, and go.mod/go.sum (golang.org/x/sys v0.48.0 to v0.49.0). No changed path is in go/cmd, go/internal/api handlers, go/internal/config or the console source.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "git diff v0.0.1..9149e7824041269a8387cf5713d6626e2add4e7a",
        "method": "read the changed paths and their diffs"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "F12",
      "claim": "The remaining changes are the console's vite 6.4.3 to 6.4.4 (npm run check:dist reports the embedded build unchanged), test/live-acceptance dependency versions, action pins in five workflows (download-artifact v8.0.2, setup-node v7.1.0, upload-artifact v7.0.2), Dependabot ignores for retracted library versions, and documentation.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
